<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B><U>AGREEMENT OF PURCHASE AND SALE</U></B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">This Agreement of Purchase
and Sale (this &ldquo;<U>Agreement</U>&rdquo;), is entered into as of the 26th day of June, 2026 (the &ldquo;<U>Effective Date</U>&rdquo;)
by and between GMR Altoona, LLC, a Delaware limited liability company (&ldquo;<U>Altoona Seller</U>&rdquo;), GMR Mechanicsburg, LLC, a
Delaware limited liability company (&ldquo;<U>Mechanicsburg Seller</U>&rdquo;), GMR Mesa, LLC, a Delaware limited liability company (&ldquo;<U>Mesa
Seller</U>&rdquo;), GMR Sherman, LLC, a Delaware limited liability company (&ldquo;<U>Sherman Seller</U>&rdquo;), GMR Las Vegas, LLC,
a Delaware limited liability company (&ldquo;<U>Las Vegas Seller</U>&rdquo;), GMR Surprise, LLC, a Delaware limited liability company
(&ldquo;<U>Surprise Seller</U>&rdquo;) and GMR Oklahoma Northwest, LLC, a Delaware limited liability company (&ldquo;<U>Oklahoma Seller</U>&rdquo;;
the Altoona Seller, Mechanicsburg Seller, Mesa Seller, Sherman Seller, Las Vegas Seller, Surprise Seller and the Oklahoma Seller referred
to herein individually and collectively, &ldquo;<U>Seller</U>&rdquo;), and Altoona PA IRF, LLC, a Delaware limited liability company (&ldquo;<U>Altoona
Buyer</U>&rdquo;), Mechanicsburg PA IRF, LLC, a Delaware limited liability company (&ldquo;<U>Mechanicsburg Buyer</U>&rdquo;), Mesa AZ
IRF, LLC, a Delaware limited liability company (&ldquo;<U>Mesa Buyer</U>&rdquo;), Sherman TX IRF, LLC, a Delaware limited liability company
(&ldquo;<U>Sherman Buyer</U>&rdquo;), Las Vegas NV IRF, LLC, a Delaware limited liability company (&ldquo;<U>Las Vegas Buyer</U>&rdquo;),
Surprise AZ IRF, LLC, a Delaware limited liability company (&ldquo;<U>Surprise Buyer</U>&rdquo;) and Oklahoma City OK IRF, LLC, a Delaware
limited liability company (&ldquo;<U>Oklahoma Buyer</U>&rdquo;; Altoona Buyer, Mechanicsburg Buyer, Mesa Buyer, Sherman Buyer, Las Vegas
Buyer, Surprise Buyer and the Oklahoma Buyer referred to herein individually and collectively, &ldquo;<U>Buyer</U>&rdquo;).</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B><U>WITNESSETH:</U></B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">1.&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;<U>Agreement
to Buy and Sell</U>. Seller agrees to sell and convey to Buyer, and Buyer agrees to buy and take title to, under the terms and conditions
set forth below, the following:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">(a)&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;The
real estate of each Seller set forth opposite each Seller&rsquo;s name on <B><U>Schedule&nbsp;1(a)</U></B>, as more particularly described
on <B><U>Exhibit&nbsp;A-1</U></B> (with respect to the Altoona Parcel, as defined below), <B><U>Exhibit&nbsp;A-2</U></B> (with respect
to the Mechanicsburg Parcel, as defined below), <B><U>Exhibit&nbsp;A-3</U></B> (with respect to the Mesa Parcel, as defined below), <B><U>Exhibit&nbsp;A-4</U></B>
(with respect to the Sherman Parcel, as defined below), <B><U>Exhibit&nbsp;A-5</U></B> (with respect to the Las Vegas Parcel, as defined
below), <B><U>Exhibit&nbsp;A-6</U></B> (with respect to the Surprise Parcel, as defined below) and <B><U>Exhibit&nbsp;A-7</U></B> (with
respect to the Oklahoma Parcel, as defined below); together with all landscaping, buildings, parking areas, fixtures and other structures
and improvements owned by Seller and located thereon or attached thereto, all rights, benefits, privileges, easements, tenements, hereditaments
and appurtenances related thereto and owned by Seller, including, without limitation, appurtenant easements over any adjacent properties,
mineral rights and oil and gas rights, subsurface rights, development rights, air rights, riparian rights, stormwater discharge capacity
allocations, sanitary sewer discharge capacity allocations and water rights, if any, and all rights, title and interests of Seller in
and to all strips and gores of any land lying in the bed of any street, road, alley, open or proposed, adjoining any such real estate,
if any, pertaining thereto (the real estate owned by Altoona Seller is referred to herein as the &ldquo;<U>Altoona Parcel</U>&rdquo;,
the real estate owned by Mechanicsburg Seller is referred to herein as the &ldquo;<U>Mechanicsburg Parcel</U>&rdquo;, the real estate
owned by Mesa Seller is referred to herein as the &ldquo;<U>Mesa Parcel</U>&rdquo;, the real estate owned by Sherman Seller is referred
to herein as the &ldquo;<U>Sherman Parcel</U>&rdquo;, the real estate owned by Las Vegas Seller is referred to herein as the &ldquo;<U>Las
Vegas Parcel</U>&rdquo;, the real estate owned by Surprise Seller is referred to herein as the &ldquo;<U>Surprise Parcel</U>&rdquo; and
the real estate owned by Oklahoma Seller is referred to herein as the &ldquo;<U>Oklahoma Parcel</U>&rdquo;; each, a &ldquo;<U>Parcel</U>&rdquo;,
and collectively, the &ldquo;<U>Real Property</U>&rdquo;). Subject to the terms of this Agreement, Seller agrees to sell and convey (i)&nbsp;the
Altoona Parcel and the related Lease and other portions of the Property to the Altoona Buyer, (ii)&nbsp;the Mechanicsburg Parcel and the
related Lease and other portions of the Property to the Mechanicsburg Buyer, (iii)&nbsp;the Mesa Parcel and the related Lease and other
portions of the Property to the Mesa Buyer, (iv)&nbsp;the Sherman Parcel and the related Lease and other portions of the Property to the
Sherman Buyer, (v)&nbsp;the Las Vegas Parcel and the related Lease and other portions of the Property to the Las Vegas Buyer, (vi)&nbsp;the
Surprise Parcel and the related Lease and other portions of the Property to the Surprise Buyer (vii)&nbsp;the Oklahoma Parcel and the
related Lease and other portions of the Property to the Oklahoma Buyer.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"></P>

