Title Policy for the Las Vegas Parcel, the Oklahoma Parcel, the Mesa Parcel and the Surprise Parcel;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

