shall pay the following closing costs:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 1.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">(A)&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;All
costs of the Title Policies and Title Commitments in excess of the portion of the premium described in <B>Section&nbsp;7(b)(i)(E)</B>&nbsp;above,
including, without limitation, the cost of extended coverage for each Parcel (other than the Mesa Parcel, the Surprise Parcel, the Las
