<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">(g)&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;Buyer
may, at Buyer&rsquo;s option, for any reason or no reason (including, without limitation, Buyer&rsquo;s inability to obtain financing),
terminate this Agreement by written notice to Seller prior to the expiration of the Due Diligence Period. Upon termination of this Agreement
