<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">a.&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&ldquo;<U>Environmental
Laws</U>&rdquo; shall mean, collectively, (i)&nbsp;all present federal, state, city, county and local laws, rules, order, decrees, regulations
